{"title":"1963 TMTA High School Comprehensive Contest Problem 5","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Problem\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Problem</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Solution_1\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 1</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Solution_2_(Answer_Choices)\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 2 (Answer Choices)</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#See_Also\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">See Also</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1963_TMTA_High_School_Comprehensive_Contest_Problem_5&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Town A is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/0/2/302e99c1c7cd91a6ae371139e5142ccef5977dca.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$60$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" /> miles to town B. If a car travels from town A to town B at an average speed of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/8/3/f8366cd6196dd8a9da6d38a3e9eafb109e99d53e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$20$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" /> miles per hour and returns to A at an average speed of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/5/1/651ba418a810d971dbc8a326d49a71fe1541fae0.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$30$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" /> miles per hour, then the average speed for the trip is:\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/9/c/99cfe78e4da7170f0e2ca8f6b09dd8289385fb5a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\text{(1)} \\quad 25 \\text{ MPH} \\quad \\text{(2)} \\quad 24 \\text{ MPH} \\quad \\text{(3)} \\quad 26 \\text { MPH} \\quad \\text{(4)} \\quad 50 \\text { MPH} \\quad \\text{(5) not determined from the information given}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"809\" height=\"18\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_1\">Solution 1</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1963_TMTA_High_School_Comprehensive_Contest_Problem_5&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 1\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Since town A is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/0/2/302e99c1c7cd91a6ae371139e5142ccef5977dca.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$60$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" /> miles to town B, we can realize that the whole trip is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/6/5/d65c32d996f628ddde6522380ba0d76dfd788fee.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$60 \\times 2 = 120$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"103\" height=\"15\" /> miles.\n</p><p>The part of the trip from town A to town B takes <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/a/b/8abbba4270447592ec6a0fad6d755e013d5f1639.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{60}{20} = 3$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"57\" height=\"38\" /> hours.\n</p><p>The part of the trip back takes <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/9/2/692759b1aada17b5baf80aa22bd6fc711794df81.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{60}{30} = 2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"57\" height=\"38\" /> hours. \n</p><p>Thus, in total the trip is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/1/4/e145708447a12177fcc4d18113581101fd59a945.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$3 + 2 = 5$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"76\" height=\"15\" /> hours.\n</p><p>This means that the average speed for the trip is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/d/3/ed362897a246b4b37b3f93a895d76a742be3ca72.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{120}{5} = \\boxed{\\textbf {(2) } 24 \\text{ MPH}}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"162\" height=\"38\" />.\n</p><p>~anabel.disher\n</p>\n<h2><span id=\"Solution_2_.28Answer_Choices.29\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_2_(Answer_Choices)\">Solution 2 (Answer Choices)</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1963_TMTA_High_School_Comprehensive_Contest_Problem_5&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 2 (Answer Choices)\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>We can eliminate answer choice 5 because there is a way to calculate this.\n</p><p>We can also realize that the car would have gone from town A to town B in a longer amount of time than from town B to town A because the car went slower from town A to town B compared to when the car went from town B to town A. Thus, the average speed for the whole trip will be have to be closer to the average speed from town A to town B than the average speed from town B to town A. This matches with answer choice <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/d/3/ed362897a246b4b37b3f93a895d76a742be3ca72.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{120}{5} = \\boxed{\\textbf {(2) } 24 \\text{ MPH}}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"162\" height=\"38\" />.\n</p><p>~anabel.disher\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_Also\">See Also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1963_TMTA_High_School_Comprehensive_Contest_Problem_5&amp;action=edit&amp;section=4\" title=\"Edit section: See Also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"clear:both; margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1963_TMTA_High_School_Mathematics_Contests\" title=\"1963 TMTA High School Mathematics Contests\">1963 TMTA High School Mathematics Contests</a> (<a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1963_TMTA_High_School_Comprehensive_Problems&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"1963 TMTA High School Comprehensive Problems (page does not exist)\">Problems</a>)</b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"30%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1963_TMTA_High_School_Comprehensive_Contest_Problem_4\" title=\"1963 TMTA High School Comprehensive Contest Problem 4\">Problem 4</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"40%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=TMTA_High_School_Mathematics_Contest_Past_Problems/Solutions\" title=\"TMTA High School Mathematics Contest Past Problems/Solutions\">TMTA High School Mathematics Contest Past Problems/Solutions</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"30%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1963_TMTA_High_School_Comprehensive_Contest_Problem_6&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"1963 TMTA High School Comprehensive Contest Problem 6 (page does not exist)\">Problem 6</a></b>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261018041744\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [show‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.018 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.038 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 87/1000000\nPost‐expand in